{"5410560":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"MAKAI CITY CHI-BA","steam_appid":5410560,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of the Streamer Prize at SHIBA GAME AWARD 2026 SUMMER<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5410560\/extras\/5cc3e8e0241ebb8a8215b725df73a8d1.avif?t=1793650938\" width=200 height=223 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fantasy RPG set in Chiba, Japan<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters have suddenly appeared, and Chiba has lost its peace. With the power of the spirits and the courage of friends, take back the city's future.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKAI CITY CHI-BA is a modern-meets-legend fantasy RPG built on the folklore of Chiba. Using the place names, history and legends of Chiba Prefecture as its motifs, it follows four high school students as they close in on the truth about &quot;CHI-BA.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where is Chiba?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiba is just east of Tokyo. It is a big-city prefecture with a quiet countryside, a long coastline and a lot of nature. Narita Airport is in Chiba, so many visitors to Japan land here, and then head straight to Tokyo without ever seeing Chiba itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Chiba holds a surprising number of strange old legends. I made this game so that more people can discover them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiba is thrown into chaos by monsters that suddenly appear. The four students have no swords and no magic. They borrow the protection of the spirits of Chiba and step forward to fight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the story goes on, a city that is somehow hard to reach and small mismatches in people's memories begin to surface. The truth hidden within Chiba itself slowly comes into view.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategic turn-based system where you spend MP (Material Points) to unleash special skills. Kendo finishers, science experiments, cheering allies on and healing potions: each of the four characters fights in a different way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A journey through Chiba<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario is based on real place names, folk tales and history. The more you play, the more &quot;another Chiba&quot; appears.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The tale of Tekona<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Oni of the Mountain of Human Bones in Kyonan town<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Umihotaru and the legend of Don Taro<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Mera-boshi legend of Tateyama<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's new in the Steam edition<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition upgrades the mobile version released in Japan.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rebuilt on RPG Maker MZ<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New towns and story events<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An extra dungeon<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More accessories<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enhanced visuals<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Improved controls<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Autosave support<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > English localization (switch between Japanese and English on the title screen)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 3-6 hours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended for<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fans of JRPGs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anyone who likes folklore and history<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anyone curious about Japan beyond Tokyo<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anyone looking for a short RPG that stays with you<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not a legendary hero who saves Chiba. It is your choices, and your bond with your friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sadayuki Nagahori works full-time at a construction machinery company and made this game alone over ten years in his spare time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and videos are welcome. No need to contact me.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of the Streamer Prize at SHIBA GAME AWARD 2026 SUMMER<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5410560\/extras\/5cc3e8e0241ebb8a8215b725df73a8d1.avif?t=1793650938\" width=200 height=223 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fantasy RPG set in Chiba, Japan<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters have suddenly appeared, and Chiba has lost its peace. With the power of the spirits and the courage of friends, take back the city's future.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAKAI CITY CHI-BA is a modern-meets-legend fantasy RPG built on the folklore of Chiba. Using the place names, history and legends of Chiba Prefecture as its motifs, it follows four high school students as they close in on the truth about &quot;CHI-BA.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where is Chiba?<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiba is just east of Tokyo. It is a big-city prefecture with a quiet countryside, a long coastline and a lot of nature. Narita Airport is in Chiba, so many visitors to Japan land here, and then head straight to Tokyo without ever seeing Chiba itself.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Chiba holds a surprising number of strange old legends. I made this game so that more people can discover them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The story<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiba is thrown into chaos by monsters that suddenly appear. The four students have no swords and no magic. They borrow the protection of the spirits of Chiba and step forward to fight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as the story goes on, a city that is somehow hard to reach and small mismatches in people's memories begin to surface. The truth hidden within Chiba itself slowly comes into view.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategic turn-based system where you spend MP (Material Points) to unleash special skills. Kendo finishers, science experiments, cheering allies on and healing potions: each of the four characters fights in a different way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A journey through Chiba<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scenario is based on real place names, folk tales and history. The more you play, the more &quot;another Chiba&quot; appears.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The tale of Tekona<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Oni of the Mountain of Human Bones in Kyonan town<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Umihotaru and the legend of Don Taro<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Mera-boshi legend of Tateyama<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's new in the Steam edition<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This edition upgrades the mobile version released in Japan.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rebuilt on RPG Maker MZ<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > New towns and story events<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An extra dungeon<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More accessories<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enhanced visuals<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Improved controls<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Autosave support<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > English localization (switch between Japanese and English on the title screen)<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 3-6 hours.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommended for<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fans of JRPGs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anyone who likes folklore and history<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anyone curious about Japan beyond Tokyo<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anyone looking for a short RPG that stays with you<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not a legendary hero who saves Chiba. It is your choices, and your bond with your friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sadayuki Nagahori works full-time at a construction machinery company and made this game alone over ten years in his spare time.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and videos are welcome. No need to contact me.<\/p>","short_description":"Four high school students and the spirits of Chiba fight monsters that suddenly appear in their hometown. A fantasy RPG where modern Japan meets local legend, built on real Chiba folklore. One developer, ten years. Turn-based, 3-6 hours. Japanese &amp; English.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5410560\/78476c9f515cd759ebb4bd4bcbcda5bba5bf646a\/header.jpg?t=1793650938","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5410560\/b7c21586f8f662d5267c80ef1f49a38f86bd58d7\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793650938","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5410560\/b7c21586f8f662d5267c80ef1f49a38f86bd58d7\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793650938","website":"https:\/\/sites.google.com\/view\/koyurugi-koubou\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 600 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Koyurugi Kobo"],"publishers":["Koyurugi Kobo"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":399,"final":399,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$3.99"},"packages":[1867934],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy MAKAI CITY CHI-BA","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1867934,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"MAKAI CITY CHI-BA - $3.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":399}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":75,"description":"Keyboard Only Option"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#ca